              "a quarter past"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "note",
          "kind": "tip",
          "tag": "Turkish logic",
          "text": "For « 5:10 », Turkish puts the number in a special case (beş<b>i</b>, üç<b>e</b>): you will understand why in module 10. For now, just memorise the ready-made blocks."
        },
