          "tag": "Don't worry",
          "text": "Even Turkish speakers apply this rule without thinking: it has become an auditory reflex. After a few days of practice, you will « hear » which suffix sounds right. This is the most valuable module in the course: everything that follows (cases, tenses, possessives) follows this mechanism."
